00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:50.991
Uh, mm, yeah.

00:00:50.991 --> 00:00:52.631
OK, cool.
Urg.

00:00:52.631 --> 00:00:53.951
Ugh.

00:00:53.951 --> 00:00:55.851
Urg.
Oh.

00:00:55.851 --> 00:00:56.901
Huh.

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:58.621
You ready to try?

00:00:58.621 --> 00:00:59.881
[HOWL]

00:00:59.881 --> 00:01:02.291
[HOWL]

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.031
C'mon kid.
Deeper.

00:01:04.031 --> 00:01:05.141
Deep from your gut.
- Right.

00:01:05.141 --> 00:01:06.531
Uh, OK.
Got it.

00:01:06.531 --> 00:01:07.581
[HOWL]

00:01:07.581 --> 00:01:10.591
[HOWL]

00:01:10.591 --> 00:01:11.951
