00:01:25.301 --> 00:01:29.541
[HEAVY BREATHING] Huh?

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:30.591
Wow!

00:01:35.871 --> 00:01:37.291
Hm.

00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:38.341
[EXCITED MUSIC]

00:01:38.341 --> 00:01:39.391
[BARKING]

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:41.291
