00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:43.181
Yaay!

00:01:43.181 --> 00:01:45.181
All right.
Come on, guys.

00:01:45.181 --> 00:01:46.331
All right.

00:01:46.331 --> 00:01:47.771
- [BABY TALK]
- Ooh.

00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:48.821
Oh.

00:01:48.821 --> 00:01:51.101
Ugh.

00:01:51.101 --> 00:01:52.831
