cool cowboy in the car?

00:01:59.671 --> 00:02:00.721
[LAUGHS]

00:02:00.721 --> 00:02:01.771
Woo-hoo!

00:02:01.771 --> 00:02:03.241
[LAUGHS]

00:02:03.241 --> 00:02:04.831
- Bye, Uncle Shep!
- Goodbye, now.

00:02:04.831 --> 00:02:05.881
