00:02:12.931 --> 00:02:13.981
Oh.

00:02:13.981 --> 00:02:16.241
Well, bye.

00:02:16.241 --> 00:02:17.291
Gobble!

00:02:20.141 --> 00:02:21.611
Mind your business, turkey.

00:02:21.611 --> 00:02:25.111
I'm-- I'm-- I'm having a moment.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.081
Gobble.

00:02:27.081 --> 00:02:28.561
Gobble.

00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:32.671
OK, moment's over.

00:02:32.671 --> 00:02:34.571
Gobble.

00:02:34.571 --> 00:02:36.551
