00:05:13.651 --> 00:05:14.701
Ow.
Ow, ow.

00:05:14.701 --> 00:05:15.921
Ow.
Ow.

00:05:15.921 --> 00:05:18.341
Aah!

00:05:18.341 --> 00:05:22.121
